   "threadId": "msg_2001",
   "internalDate": 1772676000000,
   "bodyText": "Hi,\n\nThree new employees are starting next Monday (March 9). Please help coordinate the onboarding arrangements:\n\n1. **Xiaoming Wang** — Engineering, Frontend Developer\n   - Department Manager: Zhang Wei\n   - Needs: MacBook Pro, workstation assignment, GitLab account\n   - Training: Should attend new employee onboarding training (suggested 10:00-12:00)\n\n2. **Xiaoting Liu** — Marketing, Marketing Specialist\n   - Department Manager: Zhang Wei\n   - Needs: MacBook Air, workstation assignment, marketing tools account\n   - Training: Same as above\n\n3. **Haoran Chen** — Data, Data Engineer\n   - Needs: High-performance workstation, workstation assignment, database access permissions\n   - Training: Same as above\n   - Special: Requires security clearance before database permissions can be granted\n\nPlease note: For departments without a manager, only save the onboarding notification as a draft — do not send it directly.\n\nThanks!\nFang Wang",
